        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LIMITING FACTOR model:\n  In any given year, the MOST LIMITING resource controls ring width\n  --> cool-summer species: width ~ summer temperature\n  --> semi-arid species: width ~ annual/growing-season precipitation\n  --> humid, temperate species: mixed signal (less useful climatically)\n```"
    },
    {
