      },
      "text": "## Section 2 — Cross-Dating: The Core Method"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#021",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Cross-dating is the matching of ring-width patterns (or other ring characteristics) from multiple trees to establish absolute calendar dates. It is the methodological foundation without which dendrochronology cannot function."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#022",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCROSS-DATING LOGIC:"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#023",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Tree A: rings from 1823–2024 (living)\n  +--+--+-+--+--++--+--+-+-++--+--+--+\n  year:  1823 ...  1900 ... 1950 ... 2024"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#024",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Tree B: old wood (beam from building), approximate age unknown\n  +--+-+-++--+--+--++--+--+-+-++--+--+\n  The PATTERN of wide and narrow rings is unique to a climate period"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#025",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Cross-dating: slide B along A until patterns align"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#026",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
