      },
      "text": "## Section 3 — Building a Master Chronology"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#034",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A master chronology is a composite ring-width record built by averaging detrended ring-width series from many trees. The averaging suppresses tree-individual variation and amplifies the shared climate signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#035",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
        "canonical_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "current_path": "dendrology/03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:dendrology:dendrochronology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "dendrology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dendrochronology]",
        "section": "dendrology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dendrochronology: Tree Rings, Climate Records, Cross-Dating",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCHRONOLOGY CONSTRUCTION PIPELINE:"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md#036",
      "path": [
        "03-DENDROCHRONOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:dendrology:03-dendrochronology, git-history:dendrology:03-dendrochronology]",
